      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "Can you say it in Korean?",
      "cacheKey": "b03314a1a056b827307ce797080d4b15544d9502a7f510a176d151da28c98eb8",
      "file": "audio/cache/b03314a1a056b827307ce797080d4b15544d9502a7f510a176d151da28c98eb8.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q1-question",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q1",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You’ve chosen bibimbap for dinner. How would you order it?",
      "cacheKey": "d1b33f141adc00b5b5e8c96136048c7da43fa682a566b8c06b69d41af3e62b37",
      "file": "audio/cache/d1b33f141adc00b5b5e8c96136048c7da43fa682a566b8c06b69d41af3e62b37.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q1-answer",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q1",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "비빔밥 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "05d58cd8a3d3b4c0c9678b7abbeafe280df9affccf93d14631da6601c1467a91",
      "file": "audio/cache/05d58cd8a3d3b4c0c9678b7abbeafe280df9affccf93d14631da6601c1467a91.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q1-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q1",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "Bibimbap, please. Put the dish you want before the polite phrase used to ask for something.",
      "cacheKey": "28d07a84595e6b572eb57e19a176d4a22636fdbed7ae0e51418fee83babe3b4b",
      "file": "audio/cache/28d07a84595e6b572eb57e19a176d4a22636fdbed7ae0e51418fee83babe3b4b.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q2-question",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q2",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You’d like a cup of barley tea with your meal. How do you order it?",
      "cacheKey": "f55ba766b65b45b24259148b4c22918a0b66719bd6847515e88f05e9885f6f7a",
      "file": "audio/cache/f55ba766b65b45b24259148b4c22918a0b66719bd6847515e88f05e9885f6f7a.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q2-answer",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q2",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "보리차 한 잔 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "23d051dbc3cf90aa9c5e0b08d1d9fdeeb91bf95470eec59828522bf241d65974",
      "file": "audio/cache/23d051dbc3cf90aa9c5e0b08d1d9fdeeb91bf95470eec59828522bf241d65974.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q2-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q2",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "One cup of barley tea, please. The phrase for one cup or glass comes after the drink name.",
      "cacheKey": "85283f6b335cb14fddfd58d3eff9956fc790e691b8ab41370d6aeeadf737b2a7",
      "file": "audio/cache/85283f6b335cb14fddfd58d3eff9956fc790e691b8ab41370d6aeeadf737b2a7.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q3-question",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q3",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You enjoy the dish, but want less heat. How would you ask?",
      "cacheKey": "207f48acfc04baf05f9a8a9375eb973aaf3e5cedf678344dad4eeaa22d9e9dae",
      "file": "audio/cache/207f48acfc04baf05f9a8a9375eb973aaf3e5cedf678344dad4eeaa22d9e9dae.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q3-answer",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q3",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "덜 맵게 해 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "42ade4a21acec7d9888c746e49b8e137447b846e8274be2d1cf7f04c63cc6b46",
      "file": "audio/cache/42ade4a21acec7d9888c746e49b8e137447b846e8274be2d1cf7f04c63cc6b46.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q3-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q3",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "Please make it less spicy. The word for less can also be used with other descriptions, such as salty.",
      "cacheKey": "2e50b03f202ba3117e4caa268bb677915b0fbde407c6e987cdaf3d69b0509eda",
      "file": "audio/cache/2e50b03f202ba3117e4caa268bb677915b0fbde407c6e987cdaf3d69b0509eda.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q4-question",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q4",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "Your meal comes with onions, but you’d prefer none. What would you ask?",
      "cacheKey": "fc3b8ad09775a54ccc0d27e769f92eb6fad29b4c6c038b7cac0d198349798005",
      "file": "audio/cache/fc3b8ad09775a54ccc0d27e769f92eb6fad29b4c6c038b7cac0d198349798005.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q4-answer",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q4",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "양파 빼 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "f6a413e8e4c916df6d7250c330fb7846fbe381a535d826e6643bb8595c4184a7",
      "file": "audio/cache/f6a413e8e4c916df6d7250c330fb7846fbe381a535d826e6643bb8595c4184a7.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q4-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q4",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "Please leave out the onions. The verb in this request means to remove something or leave it out.",
      "cacheKey": "162d2278cd97dbe629562bf1d14c4684dc9f5ee4d167d098a5d689eafa246f08",
      "file": "audio/cache/162d2278cd97dbe629562bf1d14c4684dc9f5ee4d167d098a5d689eafa246f08.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q5-question",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q5",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You’ve finished eating and are ready to settle up. What would you ask for?",
      "cacheKey": "2ff6997c4cd889ab35551dcf144dd299335d4658c820a520c62c345b273c0180",
      "file": "audio/cache/2ff6997c4cd889ab35551dcf144dd299335d4658c820a520c62c345b273c0180.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q5-answer",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q5",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "계산서 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "9a5b64d8db1b98d7938b78c41488b515401c61c52b01079030eb64142c20ffcd",
      "file": "audio/cache/9a5b64d8db1b98d7938b78c41488b515401c61c52b01079030eb64142c20ffcd.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q5-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q5",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "The bill, please. The first word means bill, and the ending turns it into a polite request.",
      "cacheKey": "00aac9c752c5974583833bc8c245472052e11e9408701de30690ab2434d09522",
      "file": "audio/cache/00aac9c752c5974583833bc8c245472052e11e9408701de30690ab2434d09522.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q6-question",
      "contentId": "production-restaurant-fresh-02-q6",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "You and your friend are paying for your own meals. How would you ask to handle the bill?",
      "cacheKey": "fa3387cee6e8f64ca0076b7a51f267d0af327e0bed2dfedd7f1d687400011865",
      "file": "audio/cache/fa3387cee6e8f64ca0076b7a51f267d0af327e0bed2dfedd7f1d687400011865.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
